# Review rubric for a PRD (read by scripts/review.sh plan prd). Copy to <project-dir>/review.d/prd.env to change it.
# Names are EGM shortnames: reviewer = agents/<name>.md, standard = resources/document_standards/<name>.md of the egm plugin.
# STANDARDS maps a reviewer to a standard (reviewer=standard, space separated); a reviewer without one is run without a standard.
REVIEWERS="design_critic comprehension style"
STANDARDS="design_critic=heilmeier-standard comprehension=heilmeier-standard"
# CONTEXT: files or directories (project-relative) every reviewer reads first; may be empty.
CONTEXT=".sdkit/project.md"
